The Rust code of this crate is ported from OpenBSD's mtw(4) driver
(sys/dev/usb/if_mtw.c rev 1.13, if_mtwvar.h rev 1.1, sys/dev/ic/mtwreg.h
rev 1.2) and its rate adaptation (sys/net80211/ieee80211_amrr.c rev 1.12,
ieee80211_amrr.h rev 1.4), ISC-licensed; and, for the MT7612U (src/mt76x2),
from Linux's mt76 driver (drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt76 at commit
45f9960f8cf33a9f6b44bf4ae2a0dad393b5f8ea: mt76x2/usb*.c, mt76x2/init.c,
phy.c, mac.c, mcu.c, eeprom.c and their headers, mt76x02_usb_core.c,
mt76x02_usb_mcu.c, mt76x02_mcu.c, mt76x02_mac.c, mt76x02_phy.c,
mt76x02_eeprom.c, mt76x02_util.c, mt76x02_txrx.c, mt76x02_beacon.c and their
headers, mt76x02_regs.h, mt76x02_dma.h, usb.c, mac80211.c, mt76.h,
dma.h), BSD-3-Clause-Clear-licensed. It keeps the notices of those files,
reproduced below; the code derived from each stays under its terms.

